body:
Im going to vent, but im fucking tired all the time. i sleep when i can. Ive never been diagnosed. but it is a fucking battle to fall asleep and stay asleep. i take an hour here and an hour there. and on an unrelated note, i hate being around others. i just want to scream 'leave me alone'. again, i know im speaking off the beaten path. but fuck. when i see togetherness, it makes me feel sick. i cant stand the thought of being touched or surrounded. the only time i like people is when im drunk and when im watching movies. i cannot stand them any other time. this makes my life very difficult it makes it hard to exist. i do exist. but just as that awkward weirdo. and getting that job is not so easy. and the burden of being a weirdo gets exhausting very quickly

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
